hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"80","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Abdul Malik ke aazad karda ghulam se, ek shakhs se jis ke paas Amirul Momineen Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne [qasid] bheja, phir kaha: Wo hadees kaisi hai jo tum ne mujhe Sunabihi se bayan ki? Unhon ne kaha: Sunabihi ne mujhe khabar di ke wo Amr bin Abasah ke paas aaye, phir kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se koi hadees hai jis mein na zyadati ho aur na kami? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Jo kisi gardan [ghulam] ko aazad kare to Allah Taala us [ghulam] ke har uzw ke badle us [aazad karne wale] ka ek uzw jahannam se aazad farmayega. Aur jo Allah ke raste mein ek teer phenke — chahe [dushman tak] pahunche ya na pahunche — to [us ka sawab] ek gardan [aazad karne] ke barabar hoga. Aur jo Allah Taala ke raste mein ek baal safaid kare to wo qayamat ke din us ke liye noor hoga.'"
"81","[AI-translation] [Umar ne] kaha: Doosri hadees kaisi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sunabihi ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Bakr ke peeche zuhr ya asr padhi, 'phir unhon ne pehli do rakaton mein Ummul Quran aur: Rabbana la tuzigh quloobana ba'da iz hadaitana [Aye hamare Rabb, hamare dilon ko tedha na kar jabke Tune hamen hidayat di] [Aal Imran: 8] se lekar Usi ke qaul: Innaka antal Wahhab [Beshak Tu hi dene wala hai] [Aal Imran: 8] tak padha.'"
